sg-mas-trmg-oscal
=================

This repository publishes OSCAL 1.1.2 conversion artifacts derived from the
MAS Technology Risk Management Guidelines (18 January 2021).

Source document
---------------

Title:     Technology Risk Management Guidelines
Publisher: Monetary Authority of Singapore
Published: 2021-01-18
URL:       https://www.mas.gov.sg/-/media/mas/regulations-and-financial-stability/regulatory-and-supervisory-framework/risk-management/trm-guidelines-18-january-2021.pdf

The source content remains © Crown Copyright, Government of Singapore,
published by the Monetary Authority of Singapore. The upstream PDF is the
authoritative text; the OSCAL rendering in this repository is unofficial.

The source PDF itself is NOT redistributed from this repository. The
`rlinks` in `catalog.json` point to the canonical URL above, and the PDF's
SHA256 is recorded in `provenance.json` so that downstream consumers can
reproduce the exact build.

